   {
    "id": "p_00010",
    "type": "p",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     2,
     25,
     1
    ],
    "text": "Upon successful completion, [I34]calloc[/I34]() shall return a pointer to the allocated space; if either [I35]nelem[/I35] or\n[I36]elsize[/I36] is 0, the application shall ensure that the pointer is not used to access an object.",
    "placeholders": {
     "I34": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "I35": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "I36": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     }
    },
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "p_00011",
    "type": "p",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     2,
     25,
     3
    ],
    "text": "Otherwise, it shall return a null pointer [S37][[A38]CX[/A38]][/S37] [IMG39] &nbsp;and set [I40]errno[/I40] to indicate the error. [IMG41]",
    "placeholders": {
     "S37": {
      "open": "<sup>",
      "close": "</sup>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "A38": {
      "open": "<a href=\"javascript:open_code(&#x27;CX&#x27;)\">",
